      "sourceTextSha256": "4c97d014955071da447a41aa5f983fd256f3ba7d94bb8d69dc7af5d29a2a4bdf",
      "text": "Day 9 · After breakfast, visit the Gruta do Lago Azul. A 40-minute walk leads to the cave, then you descend inside to a lake of crystal-clear water; in the morning, when the sunbeams reach the lake, the water glows an intense blue.\n\nDay 10 · After breakfast, a snorkelling tour in a crystal-clear river. Begin at the river’s spring, where you can see the water bubbling up from the ground, then float along some 750 metres of river, observing the rich underwater flora and fish: an unforgettable experience.\n\n**Anhumas**\n\nOptional\n\nPrice on request.\n\nVisitor numbers are limited to 2 groups of 8 people per day.",
